---
title: HRMS Key Call Flows
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box "Presentation"
        participant FORM as Oracle Forms
        participant CLIB as HRMS_COMMON_LIB
    end
    box "Business Logic"
        participant SEC as PKG_SECURITY
        participant EMP as PKG_EMPLOYEE
        participant PAY as PKG_PAYROLL
        participant LEAVE as PKG_LEAVE
        participant PERF as PKG_PERFORMANCE
        participant NOTIF as PKG_NOTIFICATION
        participant INTEG as PKG_INTEGRATION
        participant AUDIT as PKG_AUDIT
    end
    box "Data"
        participant DB as HRMS Oracle Schema
    end

    Note over FORM,DB: FLOW-01: User Login

    FORM->>SEC: authenticate(username, password)
    SEC->>DB: SELECT EMPLOYEES where USERNAME (stub: no hash check)
    SEC->>DB: INSERT USER_SESSIONS
    SEC-->>FORM: session_id
    FORM->>FORM: Set :GLOBAL.session_id / current_user / current_emp_id
    FORM->>CLIB: check_session on each navigation
    CLIB->>SEC: is_session_valid(session_id) [30-min timeout from LOGIN_TIME]

    Note over FORM,DB: FLOW-02: Hire New Employee

    FORM->>EMP: create_employee(name, dept, job, hire_date, salary)
    EMP->>EMP: generate_emp_number() ⚠ race condition — no SELECT FOR UPDATE
    EMP->>DB: [TRG_EMPLOYEES_VALIDATE] BEFORE INSERT — checks HIRE_DATE ≤ SYSDATE+180
    EMP->>DB: INSERT EMPLOYEES
    EMP->>AUDIT: log_action (AUTONOMOUS TXN)
    EMP->>PAY: create_salary_record(emp_id, salary) ⚠ CYCLE-01
    PAY->>DB: UPDATE SALARY_RECORDS end_date prior active record
    PAY->>DB: INSERT SALARY_RECORDS
    EMP-->>FORM: emp_id

    Note over FORM,DB: FLOW-04 / FLOW-05: Payroll Calculate → Approve → GL Export

    FORM->>PAY: calculate_payroll(run_id)
    PAY->>DB: UPDATE PAYROLL_RUNS STATUS='PROCESSING'
    loop Per employee (row-by-row ⚠ no BULK COLLECT)
        PAY->>PAY: calculate_gross_pay / federal_tax ⚠ hard-coded 2024 / state_tax / FICA
        PAY->>DB: INSERT PAYROLL_DETAILS
        PAY->>DB: COMMIT every 50 rows ⚠ partial commit anti-pattern
    end
    PAY->>DB: UPDATE PAYROLL_RUNS STATUS='CALCULATED'
    FORM->>PAY: approve_payroll(run_id)
    PAY->>DB: UPDATE PAYROLL_RUNS STATUS='APPROVED'
    PAY->>INTEG: generate_gl_journal(run_id)
    INTEG->>DB: SELECT PAYROLL_RUNS / PAYROLL_DETAILS
    INTEG-->>INTEG: UTL_FILE write pipe-delimited GL journal to GL_FEED_OUT

    Note over FORM,DB: FLOW-06: Submit Leave Request

    FORM->>LEAVE: submit_leave_request(emp_id, type, start, end, reason)
    LEAVE->>LEAVE: Validate: active employee, leave type active, tenure, backdating ≤5 days
    LEAVE->>LEAVE: calculate_business_days() ⚠ observed holidays not handled
    LEAVE->>LEAVE: check_leave_overlap() [private]
    LEAVE->>DB: INSERT LEAVE_REQUESTS STATUS='PENDING'
    LEAVE->>DB: UPDATE LEAVE_BALANCES PENDING_DAYS+
    LEAVE->>NOTIF: send_notification to manager (AUTONOMOUS TXN → queue)
    LEAVE->>AUDIT: log_action
    LEAVE-->>FORM: request_id

    Note over FORM,DB: FLOW-09: Notification Dispatch (Background — every 5 min)

    DB-->>NOTIF: [DBMS_SCHEDULER fires process_queue]
    NOTIF->>DB: SELECT top 50 PENDING EMAIL notifications
    loop Per notification
        NOTIF-->>NOTIF: UTL_SMTP.OPEN_CONNECTION ⚠ new TCP per email
        NOTIF-->>NOTIF: HELO / MAIL / RCPT / WRITE_DATA / QUIT
        NOTIF->>DB: UPDATE STATUS='SENT' or STATUS='FAILED'
    end
    NOTIF->>DB: COMMIT batch
